+// No-op LLVM target registration stubs.
+// This LLVM was built with LLVM_TARGETS_TO_BUILD=AArch64 plus the Xtensa
+// experimental target, but Zig's codegen calls LLVMInitialize<T>Target*
+// for every target it knows, so the link needs these symbols. Registering
+// nothing for a target Zig never emits code for is safe; asking Zig to
+// build for one of them fails with a clear "unknown target" error.
